{"step_index":154,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T06:12:14Z","input_tokens":2697,"cache_read_tokens":307054,"output_tokens":4719,"thinking":"`task-153` is building the blend file, which should take roughly 12 seconds. Proceeding to update the relevant README files as the necessary environment is already available. This should not block the build process.\n\n\nThe blend file now contains 668 objects including meshes, empties, cameras, lights, and an armature, organized within eight collections. The texture pipeline generates and upgrades various texture assets like pit garage, ad boards, skid marks, and procedural sky domes, along with car shaders.\n\nI'm thinking through how to approach this.\n\n\nThe sound effects pipeline processes a 1.6L V6 Turbo-Hybrid synthesizer sound, generating mixed audio and video files including engine sounds for lap and clay renders, along with silent versions. These sound effects integrate with visual renders, including new camera rigs and onboard perspectives. These enhancements include focus and depth of field parameters, live steering displays, and thermal brake glow effects, indicating a focus on realism.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"LATEST — 最新工程\\n=================\\n\\nv5_stage_anim.blend       完整交付工程：赛车模型 + 骨架 + 银石增强环境 + 2161 帧遥测动画 + 26 机位（含广播级 DOF）+ 渲染设置\\nv5_stage_env.blend        纯环境与材质基线（无动画）：改赛道建筑/贴图/光照时改 pipeline/v5_env.py 重跑生成\\nv5_stage_anim_clay.blend  白模工程：同一套动画、26 机位、DOF 与运动模糊，替换为中性雕塑灰模（Standard 视图防过曝曲线）\\n\\n打开 v5_stage_anim.blend 后：\\n\\n  1. Outliner 里按集合找东西（根 Scene Collection 保持 0 散落对象）：\\n       SCIFI_F1_2035   F1 赛车骨架 RIG_F1_Race 与全部 244 个车身/底盘/方向盘/轮组/贴花部件\\n       V5_01_Road      路面（含离线橡胶碎屑色差）/ 赛车线 / 重刹胎痕带 / 边线 / 红白路肩 / 香肠路肩 / pit lane\\n       V5_02_Terrain   地面 / 割草条纹草地 / 砾石坑 / 外围灌篱环 / 平滑大气渐变黄昏穹顶 V5_SkyDome\\n       V5_03_Barriers  护栏基座 / 金属护栏 / 顶沿灯带 / 防护网立柱\\n       V5_04_Stands    6 座看台（Empty 组件父级 + 分块观众席/顶棚/钢桁架/旗帜）\\n       V5_05_Pit       维修墙 / 指挥台大屏 / 维修区出口绿灯信号柱 / 6 车位循环车库楼 / 楼顶看台\\n       V5_06_Props     广告板 / 刹车距离牌 / DRS 提示牌 / 弯心防撞柱 / 大屏 / 人行天桥 / 裁判点 / 机库 / 起跑龙门架\\n       V5_07_Lighting  太阳主光 + 天空冷补光 + 3 盏随车柔光（Light Linking 绑定 V5_CarLightReceivers 全部赛车网格）\\n       V5_08_Cameras   26 台分镜摄影机（Cam_S01..Cam_S25）+ 全程锁定赛车的景深焦点 V5_CamFocus\\n\\n  2. 每个看台/天桥/大屏/刹车牌组/裁判点/龙门架都有组件 Empty 父物体，选中 Empty 按 G / R 即可整体移动旋转；\\n     独立环境网格原点均位于自身几何中心。只有\\\"路面本身\\\"按中心线整体生成，改赛道几何请改 track_data 的 json 重跑。\\n\\n  3. \n<truncated 586 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"d:\\\\项目session\\\\blender-supercar\\\\LATEST\\\\README.txt\""}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"# blender-supercar\\n\\n真实银石赛道整圈的 AI 程序化 F1 赛车全链路工程（Blender 5.3.0 / EEVEE 纯 CPU / 26 机位广播级运镜 + 遥测驱动 V6 混动引擎音效）。\\n\\n## 目录\\n\\n| 目录 | 内容 | 说明 |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| **[LATEST/](LATEST/)** | `v5_stage_anim.blend`、`v5_stage_env.blend`、`v5_stage_anim_clay.blend` | **最新工程，只放这三个**（彩色完整动画 / 纯环境 / 白模动画） |\\n| [pipeline/](pipeline/) | `gen_textures.py`、`v5_env.py`、`v5_anim.py`、`v5_clay.py`、`v5_stills.py`、`v5_viewport_fast.py`、`v5_preview.py`、`synth_sfx.py`、`render_v5.py`、`render_clay.py`、`mux_v5.sh`、`mux_clay.sh`、`v4_stage_rig.blend` | 现役全自动脚本管线；`v4_stage_rig.blend` 是模型+骨架输入 |\\n| [renders_v5/](renders_v5/) | 引擎混音成片 `*_sfx_1080p.mp4`、纯配乐成片 `*_1080p.mp4`、无声版 `*_silent.mp4`、`sfx_engine_90s.wav`、`audio_v5_sfx_mix_90s.m4a`、`stills/`、`clay_stills/`、`frames/`、`clay_frames/` | 最新视频、音轨与 26 镜头剧照产物 |\\n| [textures/](textures/) | 人群 / 车库楼 / 赞助广告板 / 刹车牌 / DRS 牌 / 实时计时大屏贴图 | 由 `pipeline/gen_textures.py`（Pillow）高清程序化生成 |\\n| [track_data/](track_data/) | Silverstone / Monza 的 json+csv+生成器 | **改赛道几何与速度规划就改这里** |\\n| [audio/](audio/) | `audio.wav`（原曲）、`beats.json`、`cue.json` | 108 BPM 拍点数据 |\\n| **[scenes/](scenes/)** | 场景库：历届赛历、天气预设、8 个精选场景卡、AI 提示词包 | **拍什么先看这里** |\\n| [docs/](docs/) | [docs/README_V5.md](docs/README_V5.md)（主技术文档）、`README_V4.md`、赛道数据说明 | 物理规则、机位表、材质/遥测/音效细节 |\\n| [archive/](archive/) | `blend/` 旧工程、`scripts/` 旧脚本、`renders/` 旧成片 | 只读归档，勿在此修改